<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.62 points off FTSE, Apr 21.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.62 points off FTSE, Apr 21.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on April 21 and analysts estimate this will take 1.62 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>						   DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>						   (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>	     COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>    * RMC Group		  18.70  23.375   0.351</p>
<p>    * Reed International     18.95  23.688   0.781</p>
<p>    * Rolls Royce		 3.30   4.125   0.354</p>
<p>    * Smiths Industries	 6.15   7.380   0.133</p>
<p>	 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
